{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103290","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910329001:1":{"text":"我听到，洋流再次捎来了母瑚慈爱的声音。","source_cn":"我听到，洋流再次捎来了母瑚慈爱的声音。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x47C72765D02E2B97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910329002:1":{"text":"它已重新呼吸……尽管失去了一些力量，但依旧充满生机。以更多养料补充，洄游季便能顺利继续。","source_cn":"它已重新呼吸……尽管失去了一些力量，但依旧充满生机。以...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5BBC5D1AC63F1A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910329003:1":{"text":"我听到，水流为此欣喜不已。它们说：繁育池已恢复如初。","source_cn":"我听到，水流为此欣喜不已。它们说：繁育池已恢复如初。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x922ACBFB198E1671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910329004:1":{"text":"太好了，阿嬷说得对，只要有家人和朋友在身边，就什么都能做得到！","source_cn":"太好了，阿嬷说得对，只要有家人和朋友在身边，就什么都能...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x320A493FEF5C16BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910329005:1":{"text":"还好大家及时挽回了事态。","source_cn":"还好大家及时挽回了事态。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x390F536807EF37C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_